# ── Paren.Works: glenn@paren.works ──
IMAPAccount paren-glenn
Host mail.privateemail.com
User glenn@paren.works
PassCmd "pass email/paren.works/glenn"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore paren-glenn-remote
Account paren-glenn

MaildirStore paren-glenn-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/Paren-Glenn/
Inbox ~/Mail/Paren-Glenn/Inbox

Channel paren-glenn
Far :paren-glenn-remote:
Near :paren-glenn-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *

# ── Paren.Works: hello@paren.works ──
IMAPAccount paren-hello
Host mail.privateemail.com
User hello@paren.works
PassCmd "pass email/paren.works/hello"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt

IMAPStore paren-hello-remote
Account paren-hello

MaildirStore paren-hello-local
Subfolders Verbatim
Path ~/Mail/Paren-Hello/
Inbox ~/Mail/Paren-Hello/Inbox

Channel paren-hello
Far :paren-hello-remote:
Near :paren-hello-local:
Patterns *
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
